riated in this item shall be available for trauma recovery and training in women’s institutions. This amount shall be available for state operations or local assistance.</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr></tbody></table></caml:Content></caml:BudgetItem></caml:Fragment></caml:BillSection><caml:BillSection id="id_512B2230-987D-4919-A321-5F7214C1EC7D"><caml:Num>SEC. 173.</caml:Num><caml:ActionLine action="IS_ADDED" xlink:href="urn:caml:statutes2026:CHP202600019:caml#xpointer(%2Fcaml%3AMeasureDoc%2Fcaml%3ABill%2Fcaml%3ABillSection%5Bcaml%3ANum%3D'SEC.%202.00.'%5D%2Fcaml%3ABudgetItem%5B%40num%3D'5225-020-0001'%5D)" xlink:label="fractionType: BUDGET_ITEM||budgetItem: 5225-020-0001" xlink:type="locator">Item 5225-020-0001 is added to Section 2.00 of the <caml:DocName>Budget Act of 2026</caml:DocName>, to read:</caml:ActionLine><caml:Fragment><caml:BudgetItem id="id_3B9836AE-F306-4E94-AB66-B8B15FD59D7A" num="5225-020-0001"><caml:Content><table cellspacing="0" class="Abutted" id="id_7C655F1A-57F5-4DCE-99B6-D1B93FBF36E1" width="416"><tbody><tr style="keep-together.within-page:always;"><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="336"><p class="Stub"><caml:NumSpan>5225-020-0001</caml:NumSpan>—For support of Department of Corrections and Rehabilitation <span class="DottedLeaders"/></p></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80">2,150,000</td></tr><tr style="keep-with-next.within-page:always;"><td valign="top" width="24"/><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="392">Schedule:</td></tr><tr style="keep-together.within-page:always;"><td valign="top" width="24"/><td valign="top" width="24">(1)</td><td colspan="4" valign="top" width="212">4590-Rehabilitative Programs—Cognitive Behavioral Therapy and Reentry Services<span class="DottedLeaders"/></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="73">2,150,000</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr><tr style="keep-with-next.within-page:always;"><td width="24"/><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="392">Provisions:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="24"/><td valign="top" width="24">1.</td><td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">Of the amount appropriated in this item, $850,000 shall be available for the Anti-Recidivism Coalition to support its Ranch operations.</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="24"/><td valign="top" width="24">2.</td><td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">Of the amount appropriated in this item, $1,300,000 shall be available for the Anti-Recidivism Coalition to support its Sound Studio Capital projects.</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr></tbody></table></caml:Content></caml:BudgetItem></caml:Fragment></caml:BillSection><caml:BillSection id="id_E5C74C5F-CAA6-4048-B758-A833DC724486"><caml:Num>SEC. 174.</caml:Num><caml:ActionLine action="IS_ADDED" xlink:href="urn:caml:statutes2026:CHP202600019:caml#xpointer(%2Fcaml%3AMeasureDoc%2Fcaml%3ABill%2Fcaml%3ABillSection%5Bcaml%3ANum%3D'SEC.%202.00.'%5D%2Fcaml%3ABudgetItem%5B%40num%3D'5225-022-0001'%5D)" xlink:label="fractionType: BUDGET_ITEM||budgetItem: 5225-022-0001" xlink:type="locator">Item 5225-022-0001 is added to Section 2.00 of the <caml:DocName>Budget Act of 2026</caml:DocName>, to read:</caml:ActionLine><caml:Fragment><caml:BudgetItem id="id_D22C7521-B2D8-4DCF-9C6E-A23E46ABF277" num="5225-022-0001"><caml:Content><table cellspacing="0" class="Abutted" id="id_D8677234-57A6-4671-9D53-DC2963522552" width="416"><tbody><tr style="keep-together.within-page:always;"><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="336"><p class="Stub"><caml:NumSpan>5225-022-0001</caml:NumSpan>—For support of Department of Corrections and Rehabilitation <span class="DottedLeaders"/></p></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80">760,000</td></tr><tr style="keep-with-next.within-page:always;"><td valign="top" width="24"/><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="392">Schedule:</td></tr><tr style="keep-together.within-page:always;"><td valign="top" width="24"/><td valign="top" width="24">(1)</td><td colspan="4" valign="top" width="212">4590-Rehabilitative Programs—Cognitive Behavioral Therapy and Reentry Services<span class="DottedLeaders"/></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="73">760,000</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr><tr style="keep-with-next.within-page:always;"><td width="24"/><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="392">Provisions:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="24"/><td valign="top" width="24">1.</td><td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">The amount appropriated in this item shall be available for the Anti-Recidivism Coalition to support its Hollywood Cinema Production Resources Dorm Program. This amount shall be available for state operations or local assistance.</td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80"/></tr></tbody></table></caml:Content></caml:BudgetItem></caml:Fragment></caml:BillSection><caml:BillSection id="id_D1FE9C5B-88B1-4980-90F3-33ED3969D3FE"><caml:Num>SEC. 175.</caml:Num><caml:ActionLine action="IS_AMENDED" xlink:href="urn:caml:statutes2026:CHP202600019:caml#xpointer(%2Fcaml%3AMeasureDoc%2Fcaml%3ABill%2Fcaml%3ABillSection%5Bcaml%3ANum%3D'SEC.%202.00.'%5D%2Fcaml%3ABudgetItem%5B%40num%3D'5227-110-0001'%5D)" xlink:label="fractionType: BUDGET_ITEM||budgetItem: 5227-110-0001" xlink:type="locator">Item 5227-110-0001 of Section 2.00 of the <caml:DocName>Budget Act of 2026</caml:DocName> is amended to read:</caml:ActionLine><caml:Fragment><caml:BudgetItem id="id_4FC09AAA-C8EE-4277-BA20-1B969BEECFCA" num="5227-110-0001"><caml:Content><table cellspacing="0" class="Abutted" id="id_1E03F940-936D-4680-9F30-9A8F44C8061C" width="416"><tbody><tr style="keep-together.within-page:always;"><td colspan="7" valign="top" width="336"><p class="Stub"><caml:NumSpan>5227-110-0001</caml:NumSpan>—For local assistance, Board of State and Community Corrections<span class="DottedLeaders"/></p></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" width="80">3,000,000</td></tr><tr style="keep-with-next.within-page:always;